<p class="para" dir="ltr"><strong>✔ How many puffs does the FEED TANK 120K provide?</strong></p>
<p class="para" dir="ltr"><span>The FEED TANK 120K delivers </span><span>up to 120,000 puffs</span><span>, making it one of the longest-lasting devices in its class. Actual puff count may vary depending on usage habits.</span></p>
<hr>
<p class="para" dir="ltr"><strong>✔ What makes the FEED TANK 120K different from other devices?</strong></p>
<p class="para" dir="ltr"><span>The FEED TANK 120K features </span><span>4 alternating mesh coils</span><span> that switch during use. This helps maintain a smooth, consistent flavour experience from the first puff to the last.</span></p>
<p class="para" dir="ltr"><span>The device comes with a </span><span>30mL e-liquid capacity</span><span>, one of the largest tanks available, allowing for extended use with fewer interruptions.</span></p>
