<p class="para" dir="ltr"><span>Absolutely. The FEED TANK 120K comes with </span><span>adjustable airflow</span><span>, allowing you to customize your draw from a tighter pull to a more open airflow experience.</span></p>
<hr>
<p class="para" dir="ltr"><strong>✔ How long does the battery last?</strong></p>
